{"unit_id":1,"stage_id":1,"lesson":{"lesson_id":15,"lesson_key":"S1L15","stage_id":1,"title":"Ism-e-Ishaarah Qareeb (Muzakkar): كِتَابٌ ← هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ","title_i18n":{"hinglish":"Ism-e-Ishaarah Qareeb (Muzakkar): كِتَابٌ ← هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ","en":"Near Demonstrative (Masculine): كِتَابٌ ← هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ (This is a book)","ur":"اسمِ اشارہ قریب (مذکر): كِتَابٌ ← هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ","hi":"इस्म-ए-इशारा क़रीब (मुज़क्कर): كِتَابٌ ← هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ"},"arabic_Focus":"كِتَابٌ ، الْقُرْآنُ ← هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ ، هَٰذَا الْقُرْآنُ","hinglish_Focus":"Ek kitaab, Qur'an → Yeh ek kitaab hai (Jumla) • Yeh Qur'an (Qat'ah)","page_numbers":"42–43","book_page":42,"sections":[{"id":"sec_hero","type":"hero_header","data":{"arabic":"كِتَابٌ ، الْقُرْآنُ ← هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ ، هَٰذَا الْقُرْآنُ","hinglish":"Ek kitaab, Qur'an → Yeh ek kitaab hai (Jumla) • Yeh Qur'an (Qat'ah)","arabic_word":"كِتَابٌ ، الْقُرْآنُ","arabic_combined":"كِتَابٌ ، الْقُرْآنُ ← هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ ، هَٰذَا الْقُرْآنُ","hinglish_word":"Ek kitaab, Qur'an","hinglish_combined":"Ek kitaab, Qur'an → Yeh ek kitaab hai (Jumla) • Yeh Qur'an (Qat'ah)","title_en":"Ism-e-Ishaarah Qareeb (Muzakkar): كِتَابٌ ← هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ","subtitle":"Unit 1 • Lesson 15 (Book Page 42–43)","transformations":[{"before_ar":"كِتَابٌ ، الْقُرْآنُ","after_ar":"هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ ، هَٰذَا الْقُرْآنُ","before_hi":"Ek kitaab, Qur'an","after_hi":"Yeh ek kitaab hai (Jumla) • Yeh Qur'an (Qat'ah)"}]}},{"id":"sec_intro_table","type":"intro_table","data":{"title":"S1L15 — Ism-e-Ishaarah Qareeb (Muzakkar): كِتَابٌ ← هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ: Buniyadi Misaalein","caption":"S1L15 — Ism-e-Ishaarah Qareeb (Muzakkar): كِتَابٌ ← هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ: Buniyadi Misaalein","headers":["Qism / Qaa'ida","Arabi Misaal","Hinglish Mafhoom"],"rows":[["هَٰذَا + Tanween (ـٌ) = Mukammal Jumla","هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ / هَٰذَا بَيَانٌ / هَٰذَا صِرَاطٌ","Yeh ek kitaab hai / Yeh wazih bayaan hai / Yeh raasta hai"],["هَٰذَا + الْـ = Qat'ah (Yeh...)","هَٰذَا الْقُرْآنُ / هَٰذَا النَّبِيُّ / هَٰذَا الْبَلَدُ","Yeh Qur'an / Yeh Nabi / Yeh shehar (mukammal jumla nahin)"],["مَتَىٰ هَٰذَا ... (Sawaal)","مَتَىٰ هَٰذَا الْوَعْدُ / مَتَىٰ هَٰذَا الْفَتْحُ","Yeh waada kab poora hoga? / Yeh fatah kab hogi?"]]}},{"id":"sec_s1l15_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 1 • LESSON 15</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Ism-e-Ishaarah Qareeb (Muzakkar): كِتَابٌ ← هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ (Page 42–43)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">كِتَابٌ ، الْقُرْآنُ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Ishaarah (هَٰذَا)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ ، هَٰذَا الْقُرْآنُ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• كِتَابٌ ، الْقُرْآنُ (Ek kitaab, Qur'an) → هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ ، هَٰذَا الْقُرْآنُ (Yeh ek kitaab hai (Jumla) • Yeh Qur'an (Qat'ah)).</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Unit 1 mein aasaan Qur'ani alfaaz aur buniyadi ishaare/qawa'id sikhaye gaye hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 42–43):** **`هَٰذَا`** ka matlab **'Yeh'** (muzakkar) hai. Agar `هَٰذَا` ke baad **Tanween (`ـٌ`)** wala lafz aaye toh **mukammal jumla** banta hai (`هَٰذَا كِتَابٌ` = Yeh ek kitaab hai). Aur agar `هَٰذَا` ke baad **`الْـ`** wala lafz aaye toh sirf **adhoora qat'ah** banta hai (`هَٰذَا الْقُرْآنُ` = Yeh Qur'an)."}},{"id":"sec_s1l15_lbl1","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Darj zail misaalon par ghaur karein:"}},{"id":"sec_s1l15_r3","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"(هٰذَا) ka matlab Arabic mein 'yeh' (this) hai. (هٰذَا) aur tanween wala lafz milkar ek mukammal aur saada jumla banate hain. (هٰذَا) Arabic mein qareeb ki cheez ki taraf ishaarah karne ke liye istemal hota hai. Aap pehle hi jaan chuke hain ke lafz par tanween aam taur par 'hai' ke mafhoom mein aati hai."}},{"id":"sec_s1l15_lbl4","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Darj zail alfaaz aur jumlon ka tarjuma kijiye:"}},{"id":"sec_s1l15_g5","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s1l15_g5_w1","arabic":"بَيَانٌ : هٰذَا بَيَانٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بَيَانٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَيَانٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh bayaan hai","translations":{"en":"This is a clear explanation","ur":"یہ بیان ہے","hi":"यह बयान है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w2","arabic":"كِتَابٌ : هٰذَا كِتَابٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">كِتَابٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">كِتَابٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh ek kitaab hai","translations":{"en":"This is a book","ur":"یہ ایک کتاب ہے","hi":"यह एक किताब है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w3","arabic":"حَلَالٌ : هٰذَا حَلَالٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">حَلَالٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَلَالٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh halaal hai","translations":{"en":"This is lawful","ur":"یہ حلال ہے","hi":"यह हलाल है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w4","arabic":"حَرَامٌ : هٰذَا حَرَامٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">حَرَامٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَرَامٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh haraam hai","translations":{"en":"This is unlawful / forbidden","ur":"یہ حرام ہے","hi":"यह हराम है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w5","arabic":"سِحْرٌ : هٰذَا سِحْرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">سِحْرٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">سِحْرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh jaadoo hai","translations":{"en":"This is magic","ur":"یہ جادو ہے","hi":"यह जादू है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w6","arabic":"صِرَاطٌ : هٰذَا صِرَاطٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">صِرَاطٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">صِرَاطٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh raasta hai","translations":{"en":"This is a path","ur":"یہ راستہ ہے","hi":"यह रास्ता है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w7","arabic":"لِسَانٌ : وَهٰذَا لِسَانٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">لِسَانٌ : وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لِسَانٌ</span>","hinglish":"Aur yeh zabaan hai","translations":{"en":"And this is a tongue / language","ur":"اور یہ زبان ہے","hi":"और यह ज़बान है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w8","arabic":"ذِكْرٌ : وَهٰذَا ذِكْرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">ذِكْرٌ : وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ذِكْرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Aur yeh zikr hai","translations":{"en":"And this is a reminder","ur":"اور یہ ذکر ہے","hi":"और यह ज़िक्र है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w9","arabic":"إِفْكٌ : هٰذَا إِفْكٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِفْكٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِفْكٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh jhoot hai","translations":{"en":"This is a lie / falsehood","ur":"یہ جھوٹ ہے","hi":"यह झूठ है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w10","arabic":"بُهْتَانٌ : هٰذَا بُهْتَانٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بُهْتَانٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بُهْتَانٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh tohmat / buhtaan hai","translations":{"en":"This is a slander / false accusation","ur":"یہ تہمت / بہتان ہے","hi":"यह तोहमत / बोहतान है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w11","arabic":"هُدًى : هٰذَا هُدًى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">هُدًى : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">هُدًى</span>","hinglish":"Yeh hidaayat hai","translations":{"en":"This is guidance","ur":"یہ ہدایت ہے","hi":"यह हिदायत है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w12","arabic":"بَلَاغٌ : هٰذَا بَلَاغٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بَلَاغٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَلَاغٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh paighaam hai","translations":{"en":"This is a message / proclamation","ur":"یہ پیغام ہے","hi":"यह पैग़ाम है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w13","arabic":"نَذِيرٌ : هٰذَا نَذِيرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">نَذِيرٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَذِيرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh daraane wala hai","translations":{"en":"This is a warner","ur":"یہ ڈرانے والا ہے","hi":"यह डराने वाला है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w14","arabic":"عَدُوٌّ : هٰذَا عَدُوٌّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عَدُوٌّ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَدُوٌّ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh dushman hai","translations":{"en":"This is an enemy","ur":"یہ دشمن ہے","hi":"यह दुश्मन है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w15","arabic":"يَوْمٌ : هٰذَا يَوْمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">يَوْمٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَوْمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh ek din hai","translations":{"en":"This is a day","ur":"یہ ایک دن ہے","hi":"यह एक दिन है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w16","arabic":"فَوْجٌ : هٰذَا فَوْجٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَوْجٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فَوْجٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh ek giroh / fauj hai","translations":{"en":"This is a troop / group","ur":"یہ ایک گروہ / فوج ہے","hi":"यह एक गिरोह / फ़ौज है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w17","arabic":"شَيْءٌ : هٰذَا شَيْءٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">شَيْءٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَيْءٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh ek cheez hai","translations":{"en":"This is a thing","ur":"یہ ایک چیز ہے","hi":"यह एक चीज़ है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w18","arabic":"غُلَامٌ : هٰذَا غُلَامٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">غُلَامٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">غُلَامٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh ek ladka hai","translations":{"en":"This is a boy / lad","ur":"یہ ایک لڑکا ہے","hi":"यह एक लड़का है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w19","arabic":"مِلْحٌ : هٰذَا مِلْحٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">مِلْحٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مِلْحٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh khaara paani / namkeen hai","translations":{"en":"This is salty / bitter (water)","ur":"یہ کھاری پانی / نمکین ہے","hi":"यह खारा पानी / नमकीन है"}},{"id":"s1l15_g5_w20","arabic":"عَذْبٌ : هٰذَا عَذْبٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عَذْبٌ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَذْبٌ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh meetha hai","translations":{"en":"This is sweet / fresh (water)","ur":"یہ میٹھا ہے","hi":"यह मीठा है"}}],"cols":2}},{"id":"sec_s1l15_r7","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Agar (هٰذَا) ke baad aane wala lafz (الْـ) se shuru ho, toh yeh mukammal jumla nahi banta kyunke (هٰذَا) aur agla lafz milkar ek hi cheez banate hain jaise (هٰذَا الْكِتَابُ). Aisi soorat mein yeh do alfaaz aam taur par kisi doosre jumle ka hissa hote hain. iss baat ko behtar samajhne ke liye 'Yeh' aur 'Kitaab' do lafz milkar jumla nahi balke ek murakkab (phrase) banate hain jo jumle mein faa'il ya maf'ool ban sakta hai. Pehle misaal ki tarah baaqi Quranic murakkabaat ka tarjuma karein:"}},{"id":"sec_s1l15_g8","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s1l15_g8_w1","arabic":"الْحَدِيثُ : هٰذَا الْحَدِيثُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَدِيثُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَدِيثُ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh baat","translations":{"en":"This discourse / speech","ur":"یہ بات","hi":"यह बात"}},{"id":"s1l15_g8_w2","arabic":"الْقُرْآنُ : هٰذَا الْقُرْآنُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقُرْآنُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقُرْآنُ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh Quran","translations":{"en":"This Quran","ur":"یہ قرآن","hi":"यह क़ुरआन"}},{"id":"s1l15_g8_w3","arabic":"الْكِتَابُ : هٰذَا الْكِتَابُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْكِتَابُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْكِتَابُ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh kitaab","translations":{"en":"This Book","ur":"یہ کتاب","hi":"यह किताब"}},{"id":"s1l15_g8_w4","arabic":"الْوَعْدُ : هٰذَا الْوَعْدُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْوَعْدُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْوَعْدُ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh waada","translations":{"en":"This promise","ur":"یہ وعدہ","hi":"यह वादा"}},{"id":"s1l15_g8_w5","arabic":"الْفَتْحُ : هٰذَا الْفَتْحُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْفَتْحُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْفَتْحُ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh fath / kamyabi","translations":{"en":"This victory / conquest","ur":"یہ فتح / کامیابی","hi":"यह फ़तह / कामयाबी"}},{"id":"s1l15_g8_w6","arabic":"الرَّسُولُ : هٰذَا الرَّسُولُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الرَّسُولُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الرَّسُولُ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh Rasool","translations":{"en":"This Messenger","ur":"یہ رسول","hi":"यह रसूल"}},{"id":"s1l15_g8_w7","arabic":"الْبَيْتُ : هٰذَا الْبَيْتُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَيْتُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَيْتُ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh ghar","translations":{"en":"This House","ur":"یہ گھر","hi":"यह घर"}},{"id":"s1l15_g8_w8","arabic":"الْبَلَدُ : هٰذَا الْبَلَدُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَلَدُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَلَدُ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh shehar","translations":{"en":"This city","ur":"یہ شہر","hi":"यह शहर"}},{"id":"s1l15_g8_w9","arabic":"الْغُرَابُ : هٰذَا الْغُرَابُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْغُرَابُ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْغُرَابُ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh kauwa","translations":{"en":"This crow","ur":"یہ کوا","hi":"यह कौआ"}},{"id":"s1l15_g8_w10","arabic":"النَّبِيُّ : هٰذَا النَّبِيُّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّبِيُّ : </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّبِيُّ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh Nabi","translations":{"en":"This Prophet","ur":"یہ نبی","hi":"यह नबी"}}],"cols":2}},{"id":"sec_s1l15_r9","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"(مَتَىٰ) ka matlab 'kab' (when) hai aur iske saath milkar ek mukammal jumla banta hai. Niche diye gaye do jumlon ka tarjuma aap khud kijiye:"}},{"id":"sec_s1l15_g10","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s1l15_g10_w1","arabic":"مَتَىٰ هٰذَا الْوَعْدُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">مَتَىٰ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْوَعْدُ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh waada kab hoga?","translations":{"en":"When will this promise be?","ur":"یہ وعدہ کب ہوگا؟","hi":"यह वादा कब होगा?"}},{"id":"s1l15_g10_w2","arabic":"مَتَىٰ هٰذَا الْفَتْحُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">مَتَىٰ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْفَتْحُ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh fath kab hogi?","translations":{"en":"When will this victory be?","ur":"یہ فتح کب ہوگی؟","hi":"यह फ़तह कब होगी?"},"ref":"32:28"}],"cols":2}},{"id":"sec_s1l15_lbl11","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Exercise"}},{"id":"sec_s1l15_qlbl12","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"1: Darj zail ayaat mein un chhote jumlon ko nishaan-zad karein jo (هٰذَا) doosre lafz ke saath milkar banata hai"}},{"id":"sec_s1l15_s13","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s1l15_s13_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"﴿ يَغْشَى النَّاسَ هٰذَا عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَغْشَى النَّاسَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا عَذَابٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَلِيمٌ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Logon ko dhaanp lega, yeh dardnaak azaab hai","translations":{"en":"Enveloping the people; this is a painful torment","ur":"لوگوں کو ڈھانپ لے گا، یہ دردناک عذاب ہے","hi":"लोगों को ढाँप लेगा, यह दर्दनाक अज़ाब है"},"ref":"44:11"},{"id":"s1l15_s13_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"﴿ هٰذَا سِحْرٌ وَإِنَّا بِهِ كَافِرُونَ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا سِحْرٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَإِنَّا بِهِ كَافِرُونَ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Yeh jaadoo hai aur hum iska inkaar karne wale hain","translations":{"en":"This is magic, and indeed we are disbelievers in it","ur":"یہ جادو ہے اور بےشک ہم اس کے منکر ہیں","hi":"यह जादू है और बेशक हम इसका इनकार करने वाले हैं"},"ref":"43:30"},{"id":"s1l15_s13_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"﴿ سُبْحَانَكَ هٰذَا بُهْتَانٌ عَظِيمٌ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"arabic-root\">سُبْحَانَكَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا بُهْتَانٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَظِيمٌ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Aap paak hain, yeh bada buhtaan hai","translations":{"en":"Glory be to You! This is a tremendous slander","ur":"آپ پاک ہیں! یہ بہت بڑا بہتان ہے","hi":"आप पाक हैं! यह बड़ा बोहतान है"},"ref":"24:16"},{"id":"s1l15_s13_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"﴿ وَاتَّبِعُونِ هٰذَا صِرَاطٌ مُسْتَقِيمٌ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَاتَّبِعُونِ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا صِرَاطٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُسْتَقِيمٌ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Aur meri pairwi karo, yeh seedha raasta hai","translations":{"en":"And follow me; this is a straight path","ur":"اور میری پیروی کرو، یہ سیدھا راستہ ہے","hi":"और मेरी पैरवी करो, यह सीधा रास्ता है"},"ref":"43:61"},{"id":"s1l15_s13_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"﴿ فَسَيَقُولُونَ هٰذَا إِفْكٌ قَدِيمٌ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"arabic-root\">فَسَيَقُولُونَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا إِفْكٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَدِيمٌ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Toh anqareeb woh kahenge yeh puraana jhoot hai","translations":{"en":"So they will say, 'This is an ancient lie'","ur":"تو عنقریب وہ کہیں گے کہ یہ پرانا جھوٹ ہے","hi":"तो अनक़रीब वे कहेंगे यह पुराना झूठ है"},"ref":"46:11"},{"id":"s1l15_s13_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"﴿ هٰذَا هُدًى وَالَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا... ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا هُدًى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَالَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا...</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Yeh hidaayat hai, aur jin logon ne kufr kiya...","translations":{"en":"This is guidance; and those who disbelieved...","ur":"یہ ہدایت ہے، اور جن لوگوں نے کفر کیا...","hi":"यह हिदायत है, और जिन लोगों ने कुफ़्र किया..."},"ref":"45:11"},{"id":"s1l15_s13_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"﴿ فَقَالَ الْكَافِرُونَ هٰذَا شَيْءٌ عَجِيبٌ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"arabic-root\">فَقَالَ الْكَافِرُونَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا شَيْءٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَجِيبٌ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Toh kaafiron ne kaha yeh ek ajeeb cheez hai","translations":{"en":"So the disbelievers said, 'This is an astonishing thing'","ur":"تو کافروں نے کہا کہ یہ ایک عجیب چیز ہے","hi":"तो काफ़िरों ने कहा यह एक अजीब चीज़ है"},"ref":"50:2"},{"id":"s1l15_s13_s8","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"﴿ هٰذَا نَذِيرٌ مِنَ النُّذُرِ الْأُولَىٰ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا نَذِيرٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مِنَ النُّذُرِ الْأُولَىٰ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Yeh pehle daraane walon mein se ek daraane wala hai","translations":{"en":"This is a warner from among the warners of old","ur":"یہ پہلے ڈرانے والوں میں سے ایک ڈرانے والا ہے","hi":"यह पहले डराने वालों में से एक डराने वाला है"},"ref":"53:56"},{"id":"s1l15_s13_s9","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"﴿ وَهٰذَا كِتَابٌ مُصَدِّقٌ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا كِتَابٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُصَدِّقٌ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Aur yeh ek tasdeeq karne wali kitaab hai","translations":{"en":"And this is a confirming Book","ur":"اور یہ تصدیق کرنے والی کتاب ہے","hi":"और यह एक तस्दीक़ करने वाली किताब है"},"ref":"46:12"}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s1l15_qlbl14","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"2: Darj zail ayaat mein un hisson ko nishaan-zad karein jahan (هٰذَا) ke baad (الْـ) se shuru hone wala lafz aata hai"}},{"id":"sec_s1l15_s15","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s1l15_s15_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"﴿ لِلنَّاسِ فِي هٰذَا الْقُرْآنِ مِنْ كُلِّ مَثَلٍ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"arabic-root\">لِلنَّاسِ فِي </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا الْقُرْآنِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مِنْ كُلِّ مَثَلٍ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Logon ke liye iss Quran mein har qism ki misaal hai","translations":{"en":"For the people in this Quran from every kind of example","ur":"لوگوں کے لیے اس قرآن میں ہر قسم کی مثال ہے","hi":"लोगों के लिए इस क़ुरआन में हर क़िस्म की मिसाल है"},"ref":"17:89"},{"id":"s1l15_s15_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"﴿ لَوْلَا نُزِّلَ هٰذَا الْقُرْآنُ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"arabic-root\">لَوْلَا نُزِّلَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا الْقُرْآنُ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Kyun na naazil kiya gaya yeh Quran","translations":{"en":"Why was this Quran not sent down","ur":"کیوں نہ نازل کیا گیا یہ قرآن","hi":"क्यों न नाज़िल किया गया यह क़ुरआन"},"ref":"43:31"},{"id":"s1l15_s15_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"﴿ وَهٰذَا النَّبِيُّ وَالَّذِينَ آمَنُوا... ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا النَّبِيُّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَالَّذِينَ آمَنُوا...</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Aur yeh Nabi aur jo log eemaan laaye...","translations":{"en":"And this Prophet and those who believed...","ur":"اور یہ نبی اور جو لوگ ایمان لائے...","hi":"और यह नबी और जो लोग ईमान लाए..."},"ref":"3:68"},{"id":"s1l15_s15_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"﴿ وَيَقُولُونَ مَتَىٰ هٰذَا الْفَتْحُ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَيَقُولُونَ مَتَىٰ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا الْفَتْحُ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Aur woh kehte hain yeh fath kab hogi","translations":{"en":"And they say, 'When will this victory be?'","ur":"اور وہ کہتے ہیں کہ یہ فتح کب ہوگی؟","hi":"और वे कहते हैं यह फ़तह कब होगी?"},"ref":"32:28"},{"id":"s1l15_s15_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"﴿ وَأُوحِيَ إِلَيَّ هٰذَا الْقُرْآنُ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَأُوحِيَ إِلَيَّ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا الْقُرْآنُ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Aur meri taraf iss Quran ki wahy ki gayi","translations":{"en":"And this Quran has been revealed to me","ur":"اور میری طرف اس قرآن کی وحی کی گئی ہے","hi":"और मेरी तरफ़ इस क़ुरआन की वह्य की गई"},"ref":"6:19"},{"id":"s1l15_s15_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"﴿ أَنْ أَكُونَ مِثْلَ هٰذَا الْغُرَابِ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَنْ أَكُونَ مِثْلَ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا الْغُرَابِ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Ke main iss kauwe ki tarah ho jaaun","translations":{"en":"That I could be like this crow","ur":"کہ میں اس کوے کی طرح ہو جاؤں","hi":"कि मैं इस कौवे की तरह हो जाऊँ"},"ref":"5:31"},{"id":"s1l15_s15_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"﴿ مَالِ هٰذَا الرَّسُولِ يَأْكُلُ الطَّعَامَ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَالِ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا الرَّسُولِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَأْكُلُ الطَّعَامَ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Iss Rasool ko kya hua jo khaana khaata hai","translations":{"en":"What is the matter with this Messenger that he eats food","ur":"اس رسول کو کیا ہوا ہے جو کھانا کھاتا ہے","hi":"इस रसूल को क्या हुआ जो खाना खाता है"},"ref":"25:7"},{"id":"s1l15_s15_s8","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"﴿ إِنَّ هٰذَا الْقُرْآنَ يَقُصُّ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا الْقُرْآنَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَقُصُّ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Beshak yeh Quran bayaan karta hai","translations":{"en":"Indeed, this Quran narrates","ur":"بیشک یہ قرآن بیان کرتا ہے","hi":"बेशक यह क़ुरआन बयान करता है"},"ref":"27:76"},{"id":"s1l15_s15_s9","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"﴿ وَيَقُولُونَ مَتَىٰ هٰذَا الْوَعْدُ ﴾","arabic_markup":"﴿ <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَيَقُولُونَ مَتَىٰ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">هٰذَا الْوَعْدُ</span> ﴾","hinglish":"Aur woh kehte hain yeh waada kab hoga","translations":{"en":"And they say, 'When will this promise be?'","ur":"اور وہ کہتے ہیں کہ یہ وعدہ کب ہوگا؟","hi":"और वे कहते हैं यह वादा कब होगा?"},"ref":"10:48"}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s1l15_g16","type":"grace_box","data":{"text":"Jis tarah aap ab in Quranic ayaat ka kuch hissa khud samajhne ke qaabil ho gaye hain, usi tarah bohot jald aap poori aayat samajhne ke qaabil ho jayenge. In Sha' Allah!"}}]}}